  "details": "On mobile Android, version 1626, the Utility avatars by Rocktopus, have green bodies on the front and back. It might be a shader error, if I were to guess? Here's a list of avatars this is affecting\n\nUtility Error (a.k.a the Error Robot): *ironically giving me an error, and I can't grab the avatar ID*\n\nUtility BLOCKED: https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_5e0b520f-f221-4f20-82e8-9cf59ba30277\n\nUtility Quest: https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_dfabc587-b74f-430e-aba9-537a837376cb\n\nUtility WARNING: https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_4f4e60dd-6f30-4adf-b522-ba220de47962\n\nUtility NO IK: https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_a56c95d9-9237-4cce-b6cd-a070bd356810 *ironically has IK on mobile Android*\n\nGeneric Bot Test: https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_58a9c6f0-ca3f-4b81-8251-58dc7002182c\n\nRobo Ted Testing: https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_8040d8fd-18cc-4f6e-8dd3-73e08464f6f9\n\nRobo Ted: https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_171d6804-d6c7-4961-bd46-e905604ff08a\n\nRocktobot: https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_b6017527-5905-481d-ac8a-0faa231206c8 *has same green hue as Utility Robots; different color than avatar thumbnail*\n\nUtility LOADING: https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_6a339ee0-5640-4e46-8d0d-8ecf66bae828 *comes up as Utility Error, after Server Processing*\n\nUtility PC: https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_ce1dc4ca-5c9b-45f2-bb46-0e9be200c460 *comes up as Utility Error, after Server Processing*",
